content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "Person or household requesting pest control services.",
      "attributes": [
        "Property"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Property",
      "description": "The location where inspection or treatment takes place."
    },
    {
      "name": "Infestation Report",
      "description": "A report filed by a customer describing signs of pests or infestation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Home Inspection",
      "description": "A scheduled visit where a technician inspects the property and applies treatments.",
      "attributes": [
        "Customer",
        "Inspection Report",
        "Treatment",
        "Equipment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Inspection Report",
      "description": "Detailed findings recorded by the technician during an inspection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Treatment",
      "description": "Pesticide or control method used to address a specific infestation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Equipment",
      "description": "Tools or devices used by technicians during inspections or treatments."
    },
    {
      "name": "Treatment Plan",
      "description": "Document outlining recommended pest control steps provided to the customer."
    },
    {
      "name": "Technician",
      "description": "Field worker performing inspections and applying pest control treatments."
    },
    {
      "name": "Manager",
      "description": "Person overseeing operations, scheduling, and supply management."
    },
    {
      "name": "Service Records",
      "description": "Collection of records tracking completed inspections and reports.",
      "attributes": [
        "Inspection Report"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Inventory",
      "description": "Current stock of pest control equipment and materials.",
      "attributes": [
        "Equipment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Supply Order",
      "description": "Request placed by the manager to restock pest control supplies.",
      "attributes": [
        "Equipment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Supplier",
      "description": "External provider delivering pest control equipment and materials."
    },
    {
      "name": "Supply Delivery",
      "description": "Confirmed shipment of ordered supplies from supplier to the company.",
      "attributes": [
        "Equipment"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Record Keeping": {
      "objects": [
        "Manager",
        "Service Records"
      ]
    },
    "Inspection": {
      "objects": [
        "Technician",
        "Manager",
        "Home Inspection",
        "Treatment",
        "Equipment",
        "Inspection Report",
        "Treatment Plan"
      ]
    },
    "Supplies": {
      "objects": [
        "Manager",
        "Inventory",
        "Equipment",
        "Supply Order",
        "Supplier",
        "Supply Delivery",
        "Equipment"
      ]
    },
    "Reporting": {
      "objects": [
        "Customer",
        "Property",
        "Infestation Report"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- In case an object appears in multiple bounded contexts, suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Record Keeping": {
      "derived from": "Record Keeping Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Manager",
        "Service Records"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Manager -> Record Manager"
      ]
    },
    "Inspection": {
      "derived from": "Inspection Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Technician",
        "Manager",
        "Home Inspection",
        "Treatment",
        "Equipment",
        "Inspection Report",
        "Treatment Plan"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Manager -> Inspection Coordinator"
      ]
    },
    "Supplies": {
      "derived from": "Supplies Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Supply Administrator",
        "Supply Order",
        "Supplier",
        "Supply Delivery",
        "Ordered Equipment"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Manager -> Supply Administrator",
        "Equipment -> Ordered Equipment"
      ]
    },
    "Inventory": {
      "derived from": "Supplies Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Inventory Administrator",
        "Inventory",
        "Equipment Stock",
        "Supply Order",
        "Supplier",
        "Supply Delivery",
        "Equipment"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Manager -> Inventory Administrator",
        "Equipment -> Equipment Stock"
      ]
    },
    "Reporting": {
      "derived from": "Reporting Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Customer",
        "Property",
        "Infestation Report"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
